# 📚 Panduan Presentasi Project SinBot Chatbot

## 🎯 Ringkasan Project

**SinBot** adalah chatbot berbasis **RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)** untuk PT. Sintesa Inti Nusa (distributor obat). Chatbot ini bisa:
- Menjawab pertanyaan berdasarkan knowledge base
- Terintegrasi dengan WhatsApp
- Dikelola melalui web admin

---

## 🏗️ Arsitektur Sistem

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Frontend["🖥️ Frontend (React + Vite)"]
        Login[Login Page]
        Dashboard[Dashboard]
        Chat[Chat Interface]
        Knowledge[Knowledge Management]
    end
    
    subgraph Backend["⚙️ Backend (FastAPI + Python)"]
        API[REST API]
        RAG[RAG Engine]
        Embed[Sentence Transformer]
    end
    
    subgraph External["☁️ External Services"]
        MongoDB[(MongoDB Atlas)]
        Groq[Groq API - LLaMA 3.3]
        WAHA[WAHA - WhatsApp]
        N8N[n8n Automation]
    end
    
    Frontend --> Backend
    Backend --> MongoDB
    Backend --> Groq
    WAHA --> N8N --> Backend
```

