## 🌐 Alur Deployment ke VPS

### 1. Persiapan VPS
```bash
# Install Docker
sudo apt update
sudo apt install docker.io docker-compose
```

### 2. Clone Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/AbilaPrastikaNavilata/chatbot.git
cd chatbot/backend
```

### 3. Setup Environment
```bash
# Edit file .env dengan API keys
nano .env
```

### 4. Jalankan dengan Docker
```bash
docker-compose up -d --build
```

### 5. Setup Nginx (Reverse Proxy)
```nginx
server {
    server_name yourdomain.com;
    
    location /api/ {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:7860/;
    }
    
    location / {
        root /var/www/frontend;
        try_files $uri /index.html;
    }
}
```

### 6. SSL Certificate
```bash
sudo certbot --nginx -d yourdomain.com
```

