## 📊 Database Schema (MongoDB)

### Collection: `users`
```json
{
  "_id": "ObjectId",
  "username": "admin1",
  "email": "admin@email.com",
  "password": "hashed_password"
}
```

### Collection: `rag_data_knowledge`
```json
{
  "_id": "ObjectId",
  "title": "Katalog Produk",
  "content": "Isi dokumen...",
  "source": "katalog.pdf",
  "embedding": [0.23, -0.45, ...],
  "metadata": {"file_type": "pdf"}
}
```

### Collection: `whatsapp_conversations`
```json
{
  "_id": "ObjectId",
  "phone_number": "628123456789@c.us",
  "messages": [
    {"user": "Halo", "assistant": "Hai!"}
  ]
}
```

